WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.219 --> 00:00:04.070
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: Dr. Bright!

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:05.080
No Harlem Shake!

00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:09.719
I know this is going to take some brain power,
but think back to a little social media trend

00:00:09.719 --> 00:00:11.349
called the Harlem Shake?

00:00:11.349 --> 00:00:12.349
Remember that?

00:00:12.349 --> 00:00:15.179
It was funny for like a week and then went
on way too long?

00:00:15.179 --> 00:00:19.720
Well, Dr. Bright missed the Harlem Shake the
first time around, and we don't want him discovering

00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:21.070
it and bringing it back.

00:00:21.070 --> 00:00:27.170
So, Dr. Bright is now allowed access to visual
or audio recordings of the formerly viral

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:28.259
dance craze.

